@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Online Quiz System

state "Register/Login" as RegisterLogin
state "Teacher" as Teacher
state "Student" as Student
state "Create Quiz" as CreateQuiz
state "Edit Quiz" as EditQuiz
state "Save Quiz" as SaveQuiz
state "View Results" as ViewResults
state "Select Quiz" as SelectQuiz
state "Answer Quiz" as AnswerQuiz
state "Submit Quiz" as SubmitQuiz
state "View Result" as ViewResult

[*] --> RegisterLogin

RegisterLogin --> Teacher : [Logged in as teacher]
RegisterLogin --> Student : [Logged in as student]

Teacher --> CreateQuiz
Teacher --> EditQuiz
Teacher --> SaveQuiz
Teacher --> ViewResults

Student --> SelectQuiz
Student --> AnswerQuiz
Student --> SubmitQuiz
Student --> ViewResult

CreateQuiz --> EditQuiz
EditQuiz --> SaveQuiz
SaveQuiz --> ViewResults

SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult

ViewResults --> [*]

@enduml
